{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54470","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"量强弱，彼我孰优长？\n敌若势雄兵将广（辛本作「兵将广大」），吾军衰弱亦（京本作「何弱力」）难当，主帅要参详（京本作「奇计可施张」）。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}